# Type

Reading copy is 13px (`--bz-text-meta`), the size under an app name on the shelf. Chat messages, composers, prompts, and app descriptions use `bz-copy` from `src/baze-brand.css`. Do not set `text-base`, `text-lg`, or a `font-size` on those.

Titles stay on the scale in `src/styles.css`:

- App names: `font-display text-lg` (1rem)
- Section titles: `font-display text-2xl` (1.5rem)
- Heroes: `font-display text-4xl` (2.25rem)

`npm run check:type` must pass. It fails if chat or description templates drop `bz-copy` or pick a larger text size.
